      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4416,
      "text": "By the clear Book.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 2,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4417,
      "text": "Indeed, We sent it[2] down on a blessed night, We have been warning about.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 3,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4418,
      "text": "On that night, every matter of wisdom is determined[3]",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 4,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4419,
      "text": "by Our command. We have always sent messengers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 5,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4420,
      "text": "as a mercy from your Lord. He is indeed the All-Hearing, the All-Knowing,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 6,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4421,
      "text": "Lord of the heavens and earth and all that is between them, if only you had sure faith.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 7,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4422,
      "text": "None has the right to be worshiped except Him, Who gives life and causes death – your Lord, and the Lord of your forefathers.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 8,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4423,
      "text": "But they are in doubt, amusing themselves.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 9,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4424,
      "text": "So wait for a day when the sky will bring forth a visible smoke[4],",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 10,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4425,
      "text": "that will overwhelm the people. This is a painful punishment!",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 11,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4426,
      "text": "[They will cry,] “Our Lord, remove the punishment from us; we will surely believe!”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 12,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4427,
      "text": "How will they take heed, when a messenger who explained things clearly has already come to them?",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 13,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4428,
      "text": "Then they turned away from him and said, “[He is] a madman, taught by others.”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 14,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4429,
      "text": "We shall hold the punishment back for a while, but you will surely return [to disbelief].",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 15,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4430,
      "text": "On the Day when We seize [them] with the greatest assault, We will surely exact retribution.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 16,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 198,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4431,
      "text": "Indeed, We tested the people of Pharaoh before them, when a noble messenger came to them,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 17,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
      "ruku": 431,
      "hizbQuarter": 199,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 4432,
      "text": "[saying], “Hand over to me the slaves of Allah[5]. I am indeed a trustworthy messenger to you,",
      "surah": {
        "number": 44,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الدُّخَانِ",
        "englishName": "Ad-Dukhaan",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Smoke",
        "numberOfAyahs": 59,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 18,
      "juz": 25,
      "manzil": 6,
      "page": 496,
